+| Tree | `*.test.ts` under `src/` | Documented |
+|---|---|---|
+| phase-3 commit `7fabf5e` | 230 | — |
+| phase-4 commit `92441744` | 238 | “238 suites / 3146 tests” (commit message) ✅ consistent |
